      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Let the content creator ruin their own world or content or game. If one was to go down under, others can compete or take the throne.\n\nJust like free enterprise, we vote with our money and the same applies to our opinion and attendance to such worlds.\n\nI doubt M4 would go this route and if they did, then I see an opportunity for someone to make the next Murder game with new content and hopefully not another P2W situation.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
