  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-23T01:41:51.207Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've noticed that in the Creator Economy Program Rules, there isnt any kind of form of preventing \"Pay to Win\" content from existing. Pay to win can potentially ruin many worlds, like giving others an unfair advantage. Lets take murder 4 as an example. Lets say that if you were subscribed to them and they give you an item that can quickly help you identify the murderer. it could ruin the fun for everyone. I hope you guys will see this, as it could cause a lot of issues after release.",
